"description":"Your TextExpander snippets, on your iPhone and iPad.\n\nSign in with your TextExpander account to access your snippet library at your fingertips. Type \";addr\" to expand to your mailing address. Type \"zcal\" to expand to a link to your schedule / availability. You can type it in Messages, in Mail, in Slack, in your CRM, in your EHR. You get the idea. Your shared snippets are readily synced with the rest of your team. \n\nA KEYBOARD WITH SNIPPETS, SWIPE, EMOJI, AND AUTOCORRECT\n\nSwipe across the keys, and TextExpander now matches your path to English words and to your abbreviations. Swiped abbreviations automatically expand to their snippets. Plus you have everything else that you'd expect in a keyboard: Autocorrect, emojis (searchable by name, with skin tones, and recents), long-press for accented characters, one-handed mode, haptic feedback, and undo/redo.\n\nSNIPPETS THAT COME TO YOU\n\nStart typing, and matching snippets appear in the suggestion strip beside your word suggestions. Tap it to expand it. You never need to go looking.\n\nPERSONALIZE AND CUSTOMIZE WHAT YOU TYPE\n\nFill-ins give superpowers to your TextExpander snippets, and they work in the app as well. Type the abbreviation, complete your fill-ins, and send.\n\nWHAT YOU NEED\n\nA TextExpander account, created at textexpander.com. Then add the keyboard in Settings and switch on Full Access (TextExpander needs this to read your abbreviations and insert your snippets).\n\nYour snippets now work everywhere you type.", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":3.27273000000000013898215911467559635639190673828125, "languageCodesISO2A":["NL", "EN", "FR", "DE", "IT", "JA", "PT", "RU", "ES"], "fileSizeBytes":"119918592", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":11, "trackContentRating":"4+", "sellerUrl":"https://textexpander.com", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "trackCensoredName":"TextExpander", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/textexpander/id6805960547?uo=4", "ave